  "content": "<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;width:750px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QuzWr5u8RrU?embeds_referring_euri=https\" width=\"750\" height=\"536\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><hr><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fQzjZ48bNSK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_6e1aaa07-b0df-4b6b-8d20-208954b0942b.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhybrid-aquatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_c5ce3b6b-b781-45f5-8ee1-77746bcf41f1.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/HybridLabs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_99d4a8cb-c47a-483f-9d4b-02985d2110c0.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h2><hr><h2><strong>什么是混合水生?</strong></h2><p>混合水生是一个增强你在Minecraft中水下体验的模组！探索经过改良的河流、沼泽、海洋和海底洞穴，里面充满了新的生物、方块和生物群系。</p><p>我们热衷于捕捉真实海洋生态系统的美丽与神秘。准备好迎接一个在海洋中平衡绝妙奇观与惊险冒险的世界吧。</p><p>混合水生融合了创造性与现实感。潜入水中，探索新的地平线，揭开深蓝的秘密。准备好掀起波澜，在Minecraft的水域中邂逅前所未有的奇迹吧！</p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>特色</strong></h2><p>混合水生添加了大量海洋生物，包括新鱼类、鲨鱼、甲壳类、小生物、水獭、鹦鹉螺、一个新的小Boss等等！</p><p>该模组还增加了多种物品和方块，如潜水装备、海绵、钓钩、板条箱、海葵和新型珊瑚！</p><hr><h2><strong>依赖项</strong></h2><h3><strong>Forge:</strong></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Kotlin For Forge</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithostitched\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithostitched</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biolith\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Biolith</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Curios API</strong></a></p>\n</div><h3><strong>Fabric:</strong></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric Language Kotlin</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithostitched\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithostitched</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biolith\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Biolith</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Trinkets</strong></a></p>\n</div><hr><h2><strong>常见问题</strong></h2><p><strong>问</strong>: 你们会更新到[插入版本号]吗？</p><p><strong>答</strong>: 尚未决定，但希望能做到。</p><p><strong>问</strong>: 你们会将模组移植到[插入版本号]吗？</p><p><strong>答</strong>: 1.20.1之前的版本不会进行移植。</p><p><strong>问</strong>: 有计划与[插入模组名]兼容吗？</p><p><strong>答</strong>: 我们的使命包括为尽可能多的模组添加兼容性。</p><hr><h2><strong>其他混合实验室模组</strong></h2><p>以下是我们制作的其他项目，它们与混合水生完美融合！</p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-delights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_7e2f41ee-114d-46dd-83bc-94d678bf3535.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-birds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_2b94decf-ab97-42aa-8202-47f8c34a2c49.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_5a98dc74-9cdf-405a-bdf5-89194e3480e2.png\"></a></p><hr><h2><strong>推荐模组</strong></h2><p>以下模组与我们无关，但我们认为它们为Minecraft的海洋增添了独特的内容，值得您的关注！</p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seafarer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_8783f28d-e5ec-40b2-8541-2cfcfc864fcf.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rainbow-reef\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_c5c4c306-ff77-4b34-bd41-b1e1c21e69a7.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unusual-fish-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_e9c121b0-7bc9-449f-9c95-df37dcca7c6c.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rolling-down-in-the-deep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_c3ee62aa-5d27-49ea-b00e-2d55d4360063.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful-critters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_dfff41ab-64e7-464d-8209-938ddac0717e.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-lilis-lucky-lures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_24f88e2b-aa2f-44a2-a8c4-b8012cc531e8.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bens-sharks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_175a5ba0-61cb-4452-b780-1e9483b84a09.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oceanic-realms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_63c6cad2-8898-47a5-9887-f98dae461a22.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/starcatcher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_3f75dfdd-b0da-4264-96d4-e6c0f488df49.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fishing-real\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_8425b07f-6ffc-4ba3-9de2-f2daf094df8b.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_d8fdaf13-df67-4275-9c8e-61638a1f5b54.png\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unusual-fish-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_e9c121b0-7bc9-449f-9c95-df37dcca7c6c.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fintastic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_669296f0-faed-40e9-b908-b3dbfe69399c.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%2